# SPA fallback — MUST stay narrower than /*
#
# This file previously contained a single catch-all:
#
#     /*    /index.html   200
#
# On Cloudflare Pages, _redirects is evaluated BEFORE Functions. That one
# line meant every request — /product/x, /shop/jeans, /sitemap.xml,
# /feed.xml — was answered with the empty index.html shell before the
# function that renders real content for crawlers ever ran.
#
# The result: a month online with nothing indexed but the bare domain.
# Every meta tag, every piece of structured data, the sitemap and the
# Merchant Center feed were all being generated correctly and none of
# them were ever reachable.
#
# Routes handled by Functions must NOT appear here. Only genuinely
# client-side routes need the fallback:
#
#   /checkout        cart and delivery form
#   /admin           admin panel
#   /privacy         privacy policy
#   /sale            sale listing
#
# Handled by Functions instead (do not add them below):
#   /                /product/*      /shop  /shop/*
#   /sitemap.xml     /feed.xml       /img/*  /api/*

/checkout    /index.html   200
/admin       /index.html   200
/admin/*     /index.html   200
/privacy     /index.html   200
/sale        /index.html   200
/favorites   /index.html   200
/exclusives  /index.html   200
